<title>GERMANY: Hoechst says it too will cut sick pay soon.</title>
<headline>Hoechst says it too will cut sick pay soon.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and pharmaceuticals company Hoechst AG will also cut sick pay shortly, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Hoechst thus joins a growing list of German employers planning to implement quickly a recent change in labour laws.</p>
<p>&quot;We will implement the law,&quot; the spokesman said, adding that details still needed to be discussed with labour representatives.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
